        <type>std::vector&lt; std::string &gt;</type>
        <definition>std::vector&lt;std::string&gt; AGRemapCore::GraphCollectRow&lt; K, V, KeyHash, KeyEqual &gt;::guards</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>guards</name>
        <qualifiedname>AGRemapCore::GraphCollectRow::guards</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
The test of each ``if`` / ``else if`` branch the part sits in within its own `section`_, outermost first,
as written without its surrounding whitespace (``$swapvar == 1``); an ``else`` branch is recorded as ``else``. Unlike \ref condition, this
is the text of the section alone -- the conditions of a caller&apos;s ``run =`` are not in it -- and it is
always filled
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/AGRemapCore/model/strategies/iniFixers/graphGroupEdits/GraphCollectRow.h" line="108" column="21" bodyfile="include/AGRemapCore/model/strategies/iniFixers/graphGroupEdits/GraphCollectRow.h" bodystart="108" bodyend="-1"/>
